# Django Apps Architecture - AI Content Generation

## Main Application: blockhaus101_app

The primary Django app containing AI-powered content generation for contemporary art exhibitions.

### Models
- **[artist.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/models/artist.py)** - AI-generated artist information and biographies
- **[exhibition.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/models/exhibition.py)** - AI-generated exhibition data and metadata
- **[exhibition_text.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/models/exhibition_text.py)** - AI-generated exhibition descriptions and content
- **[exhibition_title.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/models/exhibition_title.py)** - AI-generated exhibition titles in multiple languages
- **[sitesetting.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/models/sitesetting.py)** - Site-wide configuration settings for AI generation

### Views
- **[index.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/views/index.py)** - Homepage displaying current AI-generated exhibition
- **[exhibition.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/views/exhibition.py)** - Individual AI-generated exhibition views
- **[past_exhibitions.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/views/past_exhibitions.py)** - Historical AI-generated exhibitions listing
- **[contact.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/views/contact.py)** - Contact form handling

### AI Content Generation Helpers
- **[api_openai.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/helpers/api_openai.py)** - OpenAI API integration for generating exhibition content, artist biographies, and descriptions
- **[api_getimgai.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/helpers/api_getimgai.py)** - GetImgAI API for generating exhibition images based on art disciplines
- **[img.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/helpers/img.py)** - Image processing utilities for AI-generated content
- **[string.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/helpers/string.py)** - String manipulation helpers for content formatting
- **[ip.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/helpers/ip.py)** - IP address utilities

### Automated Content Generation Commands
- **[generate_exhibition.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/management/commands/generate_exhibition.py)** - **Core command**: Generate complete AI exhibitions with titles, descriptions, and artist info
- **[generate_expo_img.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/management/commands/generate_expo_img.py)** - Generate AI exhibition images based on art disciplines
- **[generate_tweet.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/management/commands/generate_tweet.py)** - Generate and post AI-created social media content
- **[get_openai_models.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/management/commands/get_openai_models.py)** - List available OpenAI models for content generation
- **[reformulate_expo_text.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/management/commands/reformulate_expo_text.py)** - Reformat and improve AI-generated exhibition content

### Templates
- **[templates/en/](mdc:blockhaus101_app/templates/en)** - English language templates for AI-generated content
- **[templates/fr/](mdc:blockhaus101_app/templates/fr)** - French language templates for AI-generated content
- **[templates/partials/](mdc:blockhaus101_app/templates/en/partials)** - Reusable template components for exhibition display

## Data Management: base_data_app

Secondary app for managing multilingual AI-generated data and AI model configurations.

### Models
- **[data.py](mdc:base_data_app/models/data.py)** - Generic data storage for AI-generated content
- **[language.py](mdc:base_data_app/models/language.py)** - Language definitions for bilingual content
- **[data_type.py](mdc:base_data_app/models/data_type.py)** - Data type classifications for AI content
- **[ai_model.py](mdc:base_data_app/models/ai_model.py)** - AI model configurations and settings

### AI Content Management Commands
- **[generate_translations.py](mdc:base_data_app/management/commands/generate_translations.py)** - Generate multilingual AI content

## URL Routing

- **[blockhaus101/urls.py](mdc:blockhaus101/urls.py)** - Main URL configuration
- **[blockhaus101_app/urls.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/urls.py)** - App-specific URL patterns for AI-generated content

## Forms and Admin

- **[forms.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/forms.py)** - Contact form and other forms
- **[admin.py](mdc:blockhaus101_app/admin.py)** - Django admin interface for managing AI-generated content
- **[base_data_app/admin.py](mdc:base_data_app/admin.py)** - Data management admin interface for AI models and translations

## AI Content Generation Workflow

### Weekly/Monthly Automation
1. **Exhibition Generation**: `generate_exhibition` creates new exhibitions
2. **Image Generation**: `generate_expo_img` creates visual content
3. **Content Publishing**: Automated posting to website and social media
4. **Content Management**: Admin interface for reviewing and editing AI content

### Content Types Generated
- **Exhibition Titles**: Bilingual titles for each exhibition
- **Artist Biographies**: Fictional artist profiles and backgrounds
- **Exhibition Descriptions**: Detailed exhibition content and themes
- **Promotional Images**: Visual representations of exhibitions
- **Social Media Content**: Automated tweets and posts
